// UID — using a List (permitted by the same RBAC as every other read here)
// per candidate Kind, filtered client-side by ownerReference. This is one
// hop, not a recursive descendant walk: finding grandchildren is a second
// get_owner_chain(direction: "down") call issued against a returned child,
// the same iterative pattern the eventual investigation loop already uses
